# Radioactive Spider's "Search your library for a Spider Hero card" names the creature type with a word of its text (CR 612.2), so
# Artificial Evolution, changing "Spider" to "Human" in it, makes the search one for a Human Hero card - and the ability keeps the
# changed text with the creature sacrificed for its cost (CR 113.7a). Bot1's Masked Meower (Spider Cat Hero) is refused, and Gwen
# Stacy (Human Performer Hero, no Spider) is found and revealed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Radioactive Spider
Artificial Evolution
Forest
Masked Meower
Gwen Stacy
Forest x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Radioactive Spider.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Artificial Evolution.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Radioactive Spider)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Spider)
Bot1.Modes(Human)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Radioactive Spider.Subtypes = Human
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Radioactive Spider.Activate
! Bot1.Search(Masked Meower)
Bot1.Search(Gwen Stacy)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Gwen Stacy
Bot1.Revealed = Gwen Stacy
Bot1.Graveyard = Radioactive Spider; Artificial Evolution
